  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "D7D5A314A39314EC",
      "text": "Depuis que tu m’as dégoté ces algues wakamé,\\nmes plats ont énormément de succès ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "D7D5A614A3931A05",
      "text": "Je te dois une fière chandelle !\\nTu as vraiment l’étoffe d’un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e Maître[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]sse ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0300"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "D7D5A514A3931852",
      "text": "Tu sais, grâce à mon métier, on peut dire\\nque j’en rencontre, des gens différents.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "D7D5A014A3930FD3",
      "text": "Y en a des comme toi, qui foncent dans le tas,\\ncomme une rivière déchaînée... Puis y a ceux qui\\r\\nrestent bien tranquilles, comme l’eau d’un lac...[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "D7D59F14A3930E20",
      "text": "Généralement, c’est ceux-là que préfèrent\\nles personnes âgées... Mais moi, je t’avoue\\r\\nque je les trouve un peu barbants...[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "D7D5A214A3931339",
      "text": "L’eau des rivières va dans la mer, s’évapore\\ndans les nuages, puis redevient de la pluie.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "D7D5A114A3931186",
      "text": "Moi, je suis aussi imprévisible qu’un torrent\\nfurieux ! Alors, essaie un peu de me résister ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "D7D5AC14A3932437",
      "text": "J’aurais dû me douter que si Alisma a autant\\nd’estime pour toi, c’est pas pour rien !\\c\\nT’es pas du menu fretin, ça non ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "D7D5AB14A3932284",
      "text": "Pour le meilleur comme pour le pire, les eaux\\nd’un torrent emportent tout sur leur passage.\\c\\nConcrètement, ça veut dire qu’elles ont\\nun énorme impact sur ce qui les entoure.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 175,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "D7D21E14A38FFD16",
      "text": "Alors fais toujours bien attention aux personnes\\nqui t’entourent. Ces amitiés sont précieuses ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_11",
      "hash64": "D7D21F14A38FFEC9",
      "text": "En tout cas, on peut dire que la fougue de\\nta jeunesse m’a frappé de plein fouet !\\c\\nMais grâce à toi, je déborde de motivation...\\ncomme une rivière en crue déborde d’eau ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 173,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_12",
      "hash64": "D7D21C14A38FF9B0",
      "text": "Quand tu verras Alisma, dis-lui que le vieux\\nKombu a bien l’intention de se déchaîner\\r\\nencore plus ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_13",
      "hash64": "D7D21D14A38FFB63",
      "text": "Je compte sur toi, petit[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e !\\nEt j’espère que tu repasseras me rendre visite ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
